f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Rock County came in under 90% of normal in August to September in 36 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle got 44% of normal in September to October and 34% in January to February. So far in 2026 the middle ran 201% of normal in March to April. Grid 27463 had its driest year in 1958 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
